2026-07-27T11:25:44.1762954Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1763596Z i /tmp/RtmpPrYTHY/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1764019Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1764522Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1764967Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1765664Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1767044Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:25:44.1768114Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T11:25:44.2078369Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T11:25:44.2194796Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T11:25:44.2680289Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T11:25:44.2852237Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
